{"duration": 55.447, "exact_word_timing": true, "lines": [{"beat": 0, "text": "A doctor scrubbed his hands in lime bleach before touching new mothers.", "start": 0.05, "end": 2.866}, {"beat": 0, "text": "It was 1847, and childbed fever was killing mothers in hospitals.", "start": 2.946, "end": 6.458}, {"beat": 1, "text": "Some doctors mocked Semmelweis for demanding clean hands.", "start": 6.658, "end": 9.086}, {"beat": 1, "text": "Other doctors felt the request insulted their status as gentlemen.", "start": 9.166, "end": 12.065}, {"beat": 1, "text": "Women begged on their knees to avoid his ward.", "start": 12.145, "end": 14.086}, {"beat": 1, "text": "Some women gave birth in the streets to escape it.", "start": 14.166, "end": 15.934}, {"beat": 2, "text": "In May 1847, Semmelweis ordered hand washing in the First Division.", "start": 16.134, "end": 19.599}, {"beat": 2, "text": "Every doctor and student washed before ward work.", "start": 19.679, "end": 21.833}, {"beat": 2, "text": "Semmelweis later ordered washing before each vaginal examination.", "start": 21.913, "end": 24.815}, {"beat": 2, "text": "The First Division death rate fell from 18% to less than 3%.", "start": 24.895, "end": 28.009}, {"beat": 3, "text": "You see, it is like cleaning a kitchen after a greasy meal.", "start": 28.209, "end": 30.609}, {"beat": 4, "text": "Doctors in the First Division performed autopsies each morning.", "start": 30.809, "end": 33.42}, {"beat": 4, "text": "Second Division midwives did no autopsies, and their death rate stayed low.", "start": 33.5, "end": 36.71}, {"beat": 4, "text": "Semmelweis believed corpse particles stuck to doctors' hands and spread childbed fever.", "start": 36.79, "end": 40.373}, {"beat": 4, "text": "Chlorinated lime, a strong cleaning solution, washed those particles away.", "start": 40.453, "end": 43.715}, {"beat": 5, "text": "Semmelweis's ideas were accepted only after his death.", "start": 43.915, "end": 46.485}, {"beat": 5, "text": "Louis Pasteur later confirmed that germs cause disease.", "start": 46.565, "end": 48.814}, {"beat": 5, "text": "His colleagues committed him to an asylum, where guards beat him.", "start": 48.894, "end": 51.545}, {"beat": 5, "text": "The man who demanded clean hands died from a rotting hand wound.", "start": 51.625, "end": 54.547}], "words": [{"w": "A", "start": 0.115, "end": 0.14, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "doctor", "start": 0.165, "end": 0.365, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "scrubbed", "start": 0.415, "end": 0.615, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "his", "start": 0.64, "end": 0.715, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "hands", "start": 0.74, "end": 0.99, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "in", "start": 1.015, "end": 1.065, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "lime", "start": 1.115, "end": 1.34, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "bleach", "start": 1.39, "end": 1.74, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "before", "start": 1.79, "end": 1.99, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "touching", "start": 2.015, "end": 2.24, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "new", "start": 2.265, "end": 2.365, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "mothers.", "start": 2.39, "end": 2.866, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "It", "start": 2.99, "end": 3.04, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "was", "start": 3.065, "end": 3.14, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "1847,", "start": 3.19, "end": 4.215, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "and", "start": 4.345, "end": 4.42, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "childbed", "start": 4.47, "end": 4.87, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "fever", "start": 4.92, "end": 5.145, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "was", "start": 5.17, "end": 5.245, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "killing", "start": 5.295, "end": 5.47, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "mothers", "start": 5.52, "end": 5.72, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "in", "start": 5.745, "end": 5.795, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "hospitals.", "start": 5.82, "end": 6.418, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "Some", "start": 6.723, "end": 6.823, "line": 2, "beat": 1}, {"w": "doctors", "start": 6.848, "end": 7.198, "line": 2, "bea